.TH XIL\-PUBLISH "1" "2026\-07\-02" "xil\-pipeline 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xil\-publish \- generate social media post drafts from parsed episode data
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xil\-publish
[\-h] (\-\-episode TAG | \-\-tag TAG | \-\-all) [\-\-show SHOW]
[\-\-platform PLATFORM] [\-\-model MODEL] [\-\-dry\-run]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads a parsed episode JSON and uses the Claude API to draft social media posts
suitable for Facebook or Instagram.  Posts are written to the
\fBposts/\fR\fI<slug>\fR\fB/\fR directory as markdown files and printed to the log.
.PP
Requires the
.B ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
environment variable.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI\,TAG\/\fR
Episode tag (e.g. S04E01).  Mutually exclusive with \fB\-\-tag\fR and \fB\-\-all\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI\,TAG\/\fR
Raw content tag for non\-episodic formats (e.g. V01C03).  Mutually exclusive
with \fB\-\-episode\fR and \fB\-\-all\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
Generate posts for every parsed episode under the current show slug.
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI\,SHOW\/\fR
Show name override (default: from project.json)
.TP
\fB\-\-platform\fR \fI\,PLATFORM\/\fR
Target platform \(em affects post length and style guidance.
Choices: \fBfacebook\fR, \fBinstagram\fR (default: facebook)
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI\,MODEL\/\fR
Claude model ID to use for generation (default: claude\-haiku\-4\-5\-20251001)
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Print the prompt and token estimate without making an API call or writing files
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Draft a Facebook post for episode S01E01:
.B xil publish \-\-episode S01E01
.TP
Draft Instagram posts for all episodes:
.B xil publish \-\-all \-\-platform instagram
.TP
Preview prompt without calling the API:
.B xil publish \-\-episode S01E01 \-\-dry\-run
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
Required for Claude API access (unless \fB\-\-dry\-run\fR is used).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xil (1),
.BR xil\-parse (1),
.BR xil\-regen (1)
